# This file written by AI :)
#
# Statistics: the aggregate screen, the trend sparkline and the CSV export.
#
# The hidden block runs six real tests at steadily faster typing speeds so the
# trend slopes upward the way a practising user's would. 160ms down to 112ms is
# roughly 75 wpm up to 107.
#
#   seed 101  dynamics sexual green movie machines surprise advisory notify
#   seed 102  correct optimization settings until processor heaven mark sensitive
#   seed 103  reality reg directly gb disorders zealand too britain
#   seed 104  processed oral yahoo park protection nor foto baker
#   seed 105  apart display reader gps winter flood anderson falls
#   seed 106  customers bowl organization ct till catering popular home

Output docs/stats.gif

Source docs/tapes/_settings.tape
Source docs/tapes/_isolate.tape

Hide
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 101 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 160ms
Type "dynamics sexual green movie machines surprise advisory notify"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 102 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 145ms
Type "correct optimization settings until processor heaven mark sensitive"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 103 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 135ms
Type "reality reg directly gb disorders zealand too britain"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 104 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 125ms
Type "processed oral yahoo park protection nor foto baker"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 105 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 118ms
Type "apart display reader gps winter flood anderson falls"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype --words 8 --seed 106 --width 58"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 112ms
Type "customers bowl organization ct till catering popular home"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms

Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Type "ttype stats"
Enter
Sleep 4500ms

Type "ttype stats --trend"
Enter
Sleep 3500ms

Type "ttype stats --export csv | head -4"
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
